<%- include('partials/top') %>
<section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow">A CLEARER WAY TO TRACK YOUR MONEY</span><h1>Make every move<br><em>with confidence.</em></h1><p>Manage your Wealth Go account, submit deposit proof, track transactions, and request withdrawals from one secure dashboard.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-light" href="/register">Create account <span>↗</span></a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/login">Sign in</a></div><div class="trust-row"><span>● Manual payment verification</span><span>● Clear transaction status</span></div></div><div class="hero-card"><div class="card-orbit"></div><div class="mini-card-top"><span class="mini-brand"><i>W</i> WEALTH GO</span><span class="live-dot">ACCOUNT OVERVIEW</span></div><div class="mini-label">Your financial activity</div><div class="mini-value">₦ — — —</div><div class="mini-sub">Balance appears after sign in</div><div class="mini-chart"><span style="height:27%"></span><span style="height:39%"></span><span style="height:31%"></span><span style="height:52%"></span><span style="height:45%"></span><span style="height:68%"></span><span style="height:57%"></span><span style="height:85%"></span><span style="height:71%"></span><span style="height:95%"></span><span style="height:79%"></span><span style="height:100%"></span></div><div class="mini-footer"><span>Deposit requests</span><b>Admin reviewed</b></div><div class="mini-footer"><span>Withdrawal requests</span><b>Admin reviewed</b></div></div></section>
<section class="section packages"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT OPTIONS</span><h2>Choose your starting point.</h2></div><p>Package amounts are listed for reference. Any investment terms and potential returns must be clearly disclosed and verified before investing.</p></div><div class="plan-grid"><% plans.forEach((p,i)=>{ %><article class="plan-card <%= i===2?'featured':'' %>"><div class="plan-index">0<%= i+1 %></div><h3><%= p[0] %></h3><div class="plan-amount"><%= formatNaira(p[1]) %></div><div class="plan-meta">Investment amount</div><div class="plan-income"><span>Daily income estimate</span><strong><%= formatNaira(p[2]) %></strong></div><div class="plan-income"><span>30-day estimate</span><strong><%= formatNaira(p[2]*30) %></strong></div><a href="/register" class="plan-link">Get started <span>↗</span></a></article><% }) %></div><div class="risk-note"><strong>Important risk disclosure:</strong> Daily and 30-day figures are projections based on the figures supplied by the site operator, not guaranteed returns. They equal 25% of principal per day and 750% over 30 days, an exceptionally high and potentially unsustainable rate. No profits are automatically credited. Verify the business, legal authorisation, and written terms before sending money.</div></section>
<section class="section how"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">SIMPLE PROCESS</span><h2>Clear steps. Clear status.</h2></div></div><div class="steps"><article><span>01</span><h3>Create an account</h3><p>Set up your profile and add the bank details you want to use for withdrawals.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Submit payment proof</h3><p>Transfer to the account displayed by the administrator, then upload your receipt and payer name.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Admin verifies</h3><p>Your balance changes only after an administrator checks and approves your deposit.</p></article></div></section>
